\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "dean2010boronnitride"

\end_inset

This heralded a step change in graphene device quality and was one of the
 first instances of a van der Waals' heterostructure.
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "geim2013vander"

\end_inset


